## Watch UI Design Rules

| Constraint | Specification |
|---|---|
| Viewport | **390×390px** (circular) |
| Safe zone | Center **70%** of screen — avoid bezels |
| Tap targets | Minimum **48×48px** |
| Text lines | Max **3 visible lines** at once |
| Theme | **OLED dark** — pitch black `#000000` background |
| Animation | Minimal — respect battery constraints |
| Haptics | Every point scored = wrist pulse |

